@startuml dynamic_discovery
title Dynamic Discovery & Autonomous Delegation

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
top to bottom direction

' ==================== THE PROBLEM ====================
package "Challenge: Pre-defined Doesn't Work" as challenge #LightCoral {
    note as problemNote
      Traditional approach FAILS:
      ----
      <code>
      if needs_containerization:  # Can't know in advance!
          call_agent_b()
      </code>
      ----
      Discovery emerges during Claude's reasoning
    end note
}

' ==================== THE SOLUTION ====================
package "Solution: Claude Self-Reporting" as solution #LightGreen {
    note as solutionNote
      Claude recognizes during execution:
      ----
      * "This won't work in production as-is"
      * "I need different expertise for this"
      * "Let me request collaboration"
    end note
}

' ==================== IMPLEMENTATION ====================
package "Implementation: request_collaboration() Tool" as impl #LightBlue {
    note as implNote
      <code>
      @tool
      def request_collaboration(
          issue: str,
          expertise: str,  # "devops", "security"
          context: dict
      ):
          return orchestrator.delegate(...)
      </code>
      ----
      + System prompt guides when to delegate
      + Claude autonomously decides to call
    end note
}

' ==================== CHALLENGES ====================
package "Real-World Challenges" as challenges #Orange {
    note as challengeNote
      **AI Accuracy Issues:**
      ----
      | Problem | Impact |
      |---------|--------|
      | False positive | Unnecessary delegation |
      | False negative | Misses when help needed |
      | Wrong expertise | Delegates to wrong agent |
      | Context loss | Incomplete handoff |
      ----
      **Mitigations:**
      * Human-in-the-loop approval
      * Confidence threshold
      * Retry with feedback
      * Structured output validation
    end note
}

' ==================== KEY INSIGHT ====================
package "LLM Agents vs Microservices" as insight #Lavender {
    note as insightNote
      | Aspect | Microservices | LLM Agents |
      |--------|---------------|------------|
      | Logic | Pre-defined | Emergent |
      | Routing | Static rules | Reasoning |
      | Accuracy | 100% | ~85-95% |
      | Flexibility | Low | High |
    end note
}

' Force vertical layout
challenge -[hidden]down-> solution
solution -[hidden]down-> impl
impl -[hidden]down-> challenges
challenges -[hidden]down-> insight

@enduml
